{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b> Fathers shall not be put to death for children.</b> On account of the testimony of children. And if you would say, on account of the sin of children — it is already stated <b>each man shall be put to death for his own sin</b> (Sifrei; Sanhedrin 27)." "<b>Each man shall be put to death for his own sin.</b> But one who is not a 'man' dies for the sin of his father, and minors die for their fathers' sins at the hands of Heaven (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:14.442672669Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}